msgid "Recommended background {#recommended-background}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Each module contains recommendations on where in a curriculum each module "
"might be most effective. Generally, students will get the most out of these "
"modules if they have:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Some linear algebra background ( $2 \\times 2$ matrices should be "
"sufficient)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
